# ===========================================================================
# Netlify redirects
#
# /p/12 is the address that appears in shared links. It has to live on
# sized.gg and not on supabase.co - otherwise the card on X would show a
# foreign domain underneath it, and the link would look like a detour.
#
# The status code 200 is the part that matters: with it, Netlify fetches
# the response in the background and serves it under its own address. A
# real redirect (301/302) would change the address in the browser, and
# X's crawler would end up seeing supabase.co.
#
# The project address below is filled in. If the Supabase project ever
# changes, it has to be updated here by hand too - it lives in
# public/config.js, and this file does not read that, because Netlify
# does not run any JavaScript when serving files.
# ===========================================================================

/p/*  https://wbkfjvpxxlwcivqcmmpo.supabase.co/functions/v1/og/p/:splat  200

# Everything else is the app itself. Without this line, any direct request
# to a sub-address would get a 404, because only index.html sits on the
# server.
/*    /index.html                                                200
